NOTE ON DATA

This MIT licence covers the source code and documentation in this repository
only. It does NOT cover data retrieved or displayed by this application, which
belongs to its respective sources and remains subject to their own terms.

Several sources — the BIPAD Portal (NDRRMA), the Department of Hydrology and
Meteorology, and the Department of Roads, all Government of Nepal — publish no
stated licence. Their data is displayed with attribution for informational
purposes and is not redistributed by this project.

